    crm:P3_has_note "The Newar settlement of Sunaguthi, located c. 6 km south of Patan, is remarkably rich in its largely undocumented tangible and intangible heritage. Particularly the attempt to widen the main road where many of the heritage sites lie, has led to their extremely endangered status. NHDP has documented most of hose vulnerable sites." ;
